WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.118 --> 00:00:12.558
hurried toward Kids Central.

2
00:00:13.599 --> 00:00:16.581
She saw Nina, Jason, and Ethan in the hallway.

3
00:00:16.601 --> 00:00:19.002
"You're back!"

4
00:00:19.422 --> 00:00:20.063
Nina said.

5
00:00:20.083 --> 00:00:22.644
"Miss Shelly said you were sick."

6
00:00:22.664 --> 00:00:25.666
"I was sick," Izzie said.

7
00:00:25.686 --> 00:00:27.547
"I had the flu."

8
00:00:27.567 --> 00:00:30.848
"My dad has it now," Jason said.

9
00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:32.689
"He's miserable."

10
00:00:32.709 --> 00:00:36.711
"Everybody is getting sick," Izzie said.

11
00:00:38.011 --> 00:00:39.432
The kids walked into the gym.

12
00:00:40.352 --> 00:00:41.833
Suddenly everyone halted.

13
00:00:41.853 --> 00:00:43.894
"Mr. Dunn?"

14
00:00:44.374 --> 00:00:44.994
Izzie said.

15
00:00:45.014 --> 00:00:47.055
"What are you doing here?"

16
00:00:48.256 --> 00:00:49.296
Mr. Dunn laughed.

17
00:00:50.597 --> 00:00:51.957
"Aren't you happy to see me?"

18
00:00:51.977 --> 00:00:54.398
"Of course we are!"

19
00:00:54.699 --> 00:00:55.359
Nina said.

20
00:00:56.299 --> 00:00:57.780
Bobby raced into the gym.

21
00:00:59.164 --> 00:01:00.065
"Mr. Dunn?"

22
00:01:01.246 --> 00:01:03.367
"Miss Shelly has the flu," Mr.

23
00:01:03.407 --> 00:01:04.027
Dunn said.

24
00:01:04.048 --> 00:01:06.189
"So you're stuck with me today."

25
00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:09.251
All the kids laughed, except Nina.

26
00:01:10.992 --> 00:01:12.153
"What's the matter, Nina?"

27
00:01:12.433 --> 00:01:13.494
Mr. Dunn asked.

28
00:01:14.475 --> 00:01:16.736
"I'm happy you're here," Nina said.

29
00:01:16.756 --> 00:01:19.679
"But I'm sad Miss Shelly is sick."

30
00:01:19.699 --> 00:01:22.621
"Me too," Izzie said.

31
00:01:22.641 --> 00:01:26.503
"Maybe we can do something nice for her," Mr.

32
00:01:26.563 --> 00:01:27.164
Dunn said.

33
00:01:28.444 --> 00:01:31.006
"My mom makes soup when I'm sick," Jason said.

34
00:01:31.026 --> 00:01:34.768
"We don't have any ingredients for soup," Mr.

35
00:01:34.828 --> 00:01:35.449
Dunn said.

36
00:01:35.469 --> 00:01:39.111
"We can make cards," Nina suggested.

37
00:01:39.131 --> 00:01:42.834
"I have a better idea," Izzie said.

38
00:01:42.854 --> 00:01:45.396
"Let's make a 'get well' jar!"

39
00:01:45.416 --> 00:01:47.017
"What's that?"

40
00:01:47.417 --> 00:01:48.118
Ethan asked.

41
00:01:48.138 --> 00:01:52.801
"It's a jar filled with things that cheer you up," Izzie said.

42
00:01:52.821 --> 00:01:55.462
"My grandmother sent me one when I was sick.

43
00:01:56.063 --> 00:01:59.597
It had playing cards, tissues, and hard candies.

44
00:02:00.377 --> 00:02:02.557
And frog treats for Gurpy!"

45
00:02:02.577 --> 00:02:05.678
"Sounds good," Bobby said.

46
00:02:05.698 --> 00:02:07.999
"But where are we going to get a jar?"

47
00:02:08.019 --> 00:02:10.039
"And frog food?"

48
00:02:10.259 --> 00:02:11.060
Jason asked.

49
00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:13.300
Mr. Dunn laughed.

50
00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:17.361
"I'll look in the supply closet and see what I can find."

51
00:02:21.082 --> 00:02:22.743
A few minutes later he returned.

52
00:02:25.243 --> 00:02:30.831
He had construction paper, markers, stickers, ribbon, and a large jar with a lid.

53
00:02:30.851 --> 00:02:34.113
"You found everything we need!"

54
00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:35.054
Izzie said.

55
00:02:35.074 --> 00:02:36.755
"Now what?"

56
00:02:37.096 --> 00:02:37.916
Jason asked.

57
00:02:37.936 --> 00:02:42.680
"First, everyone makes a get well card," Izzie said.

58
00:02:43.741 --> 00:02:46.123
The kids got to work making cards for Miss Shelly.

59
00:02:47.404 --> 00:02:49.746
When they were finished, Izzie reached for the jar.

60
00:02:49.766 --> 00:02:53.449
"Now we add goodies to the jar."

61
00:02:53.469 --> 00:02:56.812
"I have some cough drops," Ethan said.

62
00:02:57.368 --> 00:02:58.809
"And two lollipops."

63
00:02:59.969 --> 00:03:02.470
"I have a pack of tissues," Jason said.

64
00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.531
"And dog stickers."

65
00:03:05.892 --> 00:03:07.232
Nina looked in her backpack.

66
00:03:07.252 --> 00:03:10.433
"I found some grape lip balm.

67
00:03:10.914 --> 00:03:11.854
It's brand-new!"

68
00:03:13.475 --> 00:03:16.956
Mr. Dunn added some tea bags to the jar and a package of cookies.

69
00:03:16.976 --> 00:03:19.437
"What about you, Bobby?"

70
00:03:19.817 --> 00:03:20.457
Izzie asked.

71
00:03:20.477 --> 00:03:22.918
"What will you add to the jar?"

72
00:03:23.779 --> 00:03:24.699
Bobby shrugged.

73
00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:26.480
Izzie frowned.

74
00:03:27.316 --> 00:03:29.677
"You have to contribute something."

75
00:03:29.697 --> 00:03:33.419
"Bobby made a beautiful card," Mr.

76
00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:34.079
Dunn said.

77
00:03:34.099 --> 00:03:36.900
"And I think we have plenty of stuff."

78
00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:41.842
"Okay, but the jar isn't finished yet," Izzie said.

79
00:03:41.862 --> 00:03:44.943
"Now I need to decorate it."

80
00:03:44.963 --> 00:03:47.384
"Can't we all do it?"

81
00:03:47.864 --> 00:03:48.705
Nina asked.

82
00:03:49.785 --> 00:03:50.806
Mr. Dunn nodded.

83
00:03:50.826 --> 00:03:53.187
"Miss Shelly would like that."

84
00:03:53.207 --> 00:03:56.348
"Okay," Izzie mumbled.

85
00:03:57.080 --> 00:03:59.861
"Sorry that I was being a little bossy."

86
00:04:01.081 --> 00:04:02.922
The kids started decorating the jar.

87
00:04:04.162 --> 00:04:06.483
They used ribbon, stickers, and some fabric.

88
00:04:09.924 --> 00:04:11.664
"It looks beautiful!"

89
00:04:12.084 --> 00:04:12.724
Nina said.

90
00:04:13.425 --> 00:04:14.425
Mr. Dunn nodded.

91
00:04:14.445 --> 00:04:17.426
"This was a very thoughtful idea, Izzie.

92
00:04:18.286 --> 00:04:20.767
I'll drop the jar off at Miss Shelly's house later.

93
00:04:21.587 --> 00:04:22.747
It's going to cheer her up."

94
00:04:24.068 --> 00:04:24.948
Izzie smiled.

95
00:04:25.885 --> 00:04:28.555
"Especially since we made it together!"
